## Interface: 30300
## Title: Unbound Spellbook
## Notes: Directly detects known active class abilities without relying on Blizzard's capped spellbook pages. Adds three spellbook-driven tabs: General (class-list spells and lower ranks filtered out), Professions, and a GM tab (skill line 769). Spells past the client's 1024-slot book cap pick up onto action bars via /cast macros, drawn from a pool that reuses free slots in place and never deletes a macro. /usbk macros reports the pool; /usbk adopt hands older macros to it.
## Author: OpenAI
## Version: 1.0
## SavedVariables: UnboundSpellbookDB
## OptionalDeps: multiclass-talents-ui

